WEBVTT

00:18:58.753 --> 00:19:01.853
How do you see its importance 
in the world today?

00:19:02.413 --> 00:19:05.264
So, the Arabic language,
we all need to remember

00:19:05.264 --> 00:19:08.682
that the people 
who are speaking Arabic today

00:19:08.682 --> 00:19:12.402
have contributed in the past 
to the civilization of the universe.

00:19:12.402 --> 00:19:16.092
They were part 
of that sequence of civilization.

00:19:16.092 --> 00:19:18.772
And I think the importance 
of the language becomes

00:19:18.772 --> 00:19:22.668
because the language 
brings history and culture with it.

00:19:22.884 --> 00:19:25.384
And it provides a set of values

00:19:25.384 --> 00:19:28.620
that can contribute 
into a different framework,

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:31.200
whether from an ethical perspective,